{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 18, :comments ["<b>Approached the thick cloud.</b> Within three partitions: darkness, cloud, and thick cloud — as it says ״וְהָהָר בֹּעֵר בָּאֵשׁ עַד לֵב הַשָּׁמַיִם חֹשֶׁךְ עָנָן וַעֲרָפֶל״ (Deuteronomy 4). The thick cloud is the density of the cloud of which He said to him ״הִנֵּה אָנֹכִי בָּא אֵלֶיךָ בְּעַב הֶעָנָן״ (Exodus 19)."], :book :exodus, :voice :rashi, :lang :en, :chapter 20, :notes {}, :source-witnesses nil, :timestamp "2026-08-02T08:53:20.275429257Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}